From 5ae839c12177bee79fd9ac8e4f12917e9a9c7ec9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:54:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Mustafar landing stage: structure fix 03 data (A3e)

Angular pad outline with large corner cuts and a side extension that
holds the rebuilt R structure, the entrance reshaped to the film contour
(wide lower opening, step, narrow upper trapezoid, eave beam), and an
outdoor walkway along the facility's left end with a closed boundary.
Door walkable width 2.0 m.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
